{"seq":5,"slug":"influence-and-legacy","title":"鲁迅·影响与遗产","stage":"DONE","category":"lu-xun","categoryLabel":"鲁迅","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/lu-xun/influence-and-legacy","rating":{"composite":3.76,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3,"positioning":null,"strategic":5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/02_lu-xun/5_influence-and-legacy","introMarkdown":"# 鲁迅·影响与遗产\n\n1936年10月鲁迅在上海病逝时，覆盖在他遗体上的那面写着\"民族魂\"的旗帜，并不只是一句临时的悼词。它预告了此后近一个世纪里，鲁迅将以何种分量参与中国乃至东亚的精神生活。一个一生只写了三十多篇小说、却把杂文写成时代利器的作家，最终成为现代中国被阅读、被争论、被引用得最多的人物之一。\n\n理解鲁迅的影响，需要把\"作品\"与\"形象\"分开来看。作为作家，他奠定了现代白话小说的范式，《狂人日记》《阿Q正传》《祝福》塑造了几代人对\"国民性\"的想象；作为思想者，他对\"瞒和骗\"、对看客、对奴性的解剖，提供了一套至今仍在被使用的批判语汇。这份遗产并非静止的纪念碑，而是不断被重新激活的精神资源。\n\n鲁迅的影响很早就越出国界。在日本，竹内好的《鲁迅》开创了\"竹内鲁迅\"的解读传统，《故乡》长期是中学国语教材的保留篇目；在韩国，被称为\"韩国鲁迅\"的李泳禧把鲁迅当作反抗军事独裁、追求民主化的思想导师；在更广的范围，鲁迅被韩国学者誉为\"二十世纪东亚文化地图上占最大领土的作家\"。2009年蓝诗玲（Julia Lovell）的企鹅经典英译，则把鲁迅推向了英语世界的经典序列。\n\n与此同时，鲁迅也是一份被高度制度化的遗产：鲁迅文学奖、鲁迅文学院、各地的鲁迅纪念馆与博物馆，把他编织进国家的文化体制；他的篇目在语文教材中的增删，每每引发全社会的争论。围绕\"鲁迅是否过时\"\"去鲁迅化\"的反复讨论，本身就证明了他持续的在场。\n\n本 hub 从三个层面梳理这份遗产：其一，文学与思想层面的影响——他如何奠定现代文学、如何塑造后世作家、如何留下国民性批判的长久回声；其二，国际传播与翻译——他在日本、韩国及东亚的接受，以及向西方语言的译介；其三，制度遗产与大众记忆——纪念机构、奖项与学术建制，影视与流行文化的改编，以及当代语境下围绕他的争议与现实意义。\n\n需要说明的是，对鲁迅形象在国内政治话语中\"封圣—祛魅—回归\"的变迁，本系列的\"生平与时代\"已有专章，本 hub 不再重复，而把重心放在更广义的文化影响、跨国传播与遗产形态上。读鲁迅的遗产，最终是为了看清：一个批判者如何在身后，持续地参与对现实的诊断。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"literary-and-intellectual-influence","title":"文学与思想的影响","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/lu-xun/influence-and-legacy/literary-and-intellectual-influence","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"founding-of-modern-chinese-literature","title":"现代中国文学的奠基","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/lu-xun/influence-and-legacy/literary-and-intellectual-influence/founding-of-modern-chinese-literature"},{"seq":2,"slug":"influence-on-later-writers","title":"对后世作家的影响","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/lu-xun/influence-and-legacy/literary-and-intellectual-influence/influence-on-later-writers"},{"seq":3,"slug":"national-character-critique-legacy","title":"国民性批判的遗产","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/lu-xun/influence-and-legacy/literary-and-intellectual-influence/national-character-critique-legacy"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"international-reception-and-translation","title":"国际传播与翻译","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/lu-xun/influence-and-legacy/international-reception-and-translation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"reception-in-japan","title":"在日本的接受与\"竹内鲁迅\"","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/lu-xun/influence-and-legacy/international-reception-and-translation/reception-in-japan"},{"seq":2,"slug":"reception-in-korea-and-east-asia","title":"在韩国与东亚的接受","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/lu-xun/influence-and-legacy/international-reception-and-translation/reception-in-korea-and-east-asia"},{"seq":3,"slug":"translation-into-western-languages","title":"向西方语言的译介","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/lu-xun/influence-and-legacy/international-reception-and-translation/translation-into-western-languages"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"institutional-and-popular-legacy","title":"制度遗产与大众记忆","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/lu-xun/influence-and-legacy/institutional-and-popular-legacy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"memorials-prizes-and-academia","title":"纪念机构、奖项与学术建制","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/lu-xun/influence-and-legacy/institutional-and-popular-legacy/memorials-prizes-and-academia"},{"seq":2,"slug":"adaptations-and-popular-culture","title":"影视改编与流行文化","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/lu-xun/influence-and-legacy/institutional-and-popular-legacy/adaptations-and-popular-culture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"contemporary-relevance-and-debates","title":"当代的争议与现实意义","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/lu-xun/influence-and-legacy/institutional-and-popular-legacy/contemporary-relevance-and-debates"}]}]}